      "beat_id": "BDEFS",
      "act": "DEFINITIONS",
      "lane": "CARD",
      "narration_text": "Five words before we start. CLAUDE.md: a text file in your project that Claude Code reads at the start of every session. Slash init: the built-in command that reads your project and drafts that file. Session: one run of Claude Code — it forgets everything when it ends. Pytest and unittest: two ways to run Python tests; pytest has to be installed, unittest is built in. Convention: the way this codebase does things. The briefing's job is to say it out loud.",
