      "act": "CYCLE 3 — A FRESH SESSION",
      "lane": "TERMINAL",
      "narration_text": "Now the payoff. A brand-new session — no memory of anything above — and one line: add a remove command, follow this repo's conventions, run the tests. It reads the two files, and it does exactly what the briefing said: a top-level function, one entry in the dict, a test in the existing pattern. Then it runs the file's test command, the fence blocks it, it asks, nobody answers, it stops and hands back. It never guessed.",
